{"t":"Sugar Cane","s":"sugar-cane-978e8","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Sugar_Cane_666d69.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Sugar Cane</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Sugar Cane\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sugar_Cane_666d69.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Flooring<br/>Grass</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.8<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20091221132401&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sugar_Cane_666d69.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  sugar cane.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Large plantations are found in the western part of <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a>. There is also a small field located on Treasure Hunt Island.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bug\">Firebug</a> on it to turn it into Burning Sugar Cane. All that will be left when the fire dies is Sugar Cane (Burnt), which can be harvested with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Sickle\">Sickle</a> (or equivalent). Doing so will leave Sugar Cane (Harvested) with a Bunch of Sugar Cane on top that can be picked up.\n</p>\n<br/><br/><table id=\"w-toc\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\">\n<p><b>How to make Rum</b>\n</p><p>To make <a href=\"#/wiki/Rum\">Rum</a>, you will need a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bug\">Fire Bug</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Sickle\">Sickle</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Distilling%20Machine\">Distilling Machine</a> and any fluid container like <a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">Vials</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\">Mugs</a>.<br/>\n</p><p>1. Use the fire bug on Sugar Canes to burn away the useless leaves.<br/>\n2. Use the sickle to cut it and collect the Bunch of Sugar Cane.<br/>\n3. Use the bunch of sugar canes with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Distilling%20Machine\">Distilling Machine</a>.<br/>\n4. Use the fluid container on the distilling machine to get the rum.\n</p>\nNote: Each bunch of sugar cane provides 10 seconds of rum production.<br/><br/></td></tr></tbody></table><br/><br/>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Attack Effects</li><li>Bunch of Sugar Cane</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bunch%20of%20Wheat\">Bunch of Wheat</a></li><li>Burning Sugar Cane</li><li>Cart</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Distilling%20Machine\">Distilling Machine</a></li><li>Explosion Effect</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bug\">Fire Bug</a></li><li>Flooring</li><li>Functional Objects</li><li>Grass</li><li>Homebrewed</li><li>Ivy Cottage</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a></li><li>Machines (Objects)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\">Mug</a></li><li>Natural Sweetener</li><li>Navigation</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rum\">Rum</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sickle\">Sickle</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Squeezing%20Gear%20of%20Girlpower\">Squeezing Gear of Girlpower</a></li><li>Sugar Cane (Burnt)</li><li>Sugar Cane (Harvested)</li><li>Sugar Cane Harvester NPCs</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Oat\">Sugar Oat</a></li><li>Transportation</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/treasure-hunt-quest\">Treasure Hunt Quest</a></li><li>Utilities</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Vandura\">Vandura</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">Vial</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["treasure-hunt-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"treasure-hunt-quest","quest":"Treasure Hunt Quest","step":"3-1","n":15,"title":"Descer","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}